keywords:
  - water distribution
  - leak detection
  - SCADA
  - false alarms
  - human-in-the-loop monitoring
  - simulation study
abstract: >-
  Interactive teaching dashboard and simulation study on leak alarms in a water
  distribution network: simulated hourly SCADA with leaks and leak-like events,
  rules, logistic regression and an operator-visible context check, compared on
  40 simulated networks, plus an operator incident workflow. Educational use;
  zone names, network and readings are fictional and not affiliated with any utility.
